    "head": "<header class=\"page-head\">\n  <p class=\"kicker\">Dinosaur Land</p>\n  <h1>Dinosaur Costume Ideas</h1>\n  <p class=\"lede\"><strong>Quick answer:</strong> start with the <a href=\"/c/baby-dino\">Baby Dinosaur</a> (20 min; green hoodie, felt spikes, stuffed tail), the <a href=\"/c/dino-tourist\">Dino Tourist</a> (10 min; Hawaiian shirt, dino tail, fanny pack), or the <a href=\"/c/raptor-barista\">Raptor Barista</a> (10 min; dino snout hood, tiny T. rex arms). Every costume below links to a free step-by-step build guide.</p>\n</header>",
    "tiles": "<section id=\"ssrRegion\" aria-label=\"Dinosaur Land costume ideas\">\n  <h2>All 10 Dinosaur Land costumes</h2>\n  <p class=\"intro\">Dinosaur Land is the roaring heart of the Costume Galaxy, home to ten dinosaur costumes that run from sweet to silly. Classic species builds like the Baby Dino and the Raptor share the region with joke costumes like the Dino Tourist and the Raptor Barista, plus group builds that turn the whole family into a dino pack. Most costumes center on a hoodie, felt spikes, and a stuffed tail, which makes this the friendliest region for first-time DIY builders. It suits toddlers who only want to roar, dino-obsessed kids, and parents who need something cute in under half an hour.</p>\n  <ul>\n      <li><a href=\"/c/baby-dino\">Baby Dinosaur</a><span class=\"tilemeta\">20 min \u00b7 Easy</span></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/c/dino-rangers\">Dino Rangers</a><span class=\"tilemeta\">15 min \u00b7 Easy</span></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/c/raptor-ranger\">Raptor &amp; Ranger</a><span class=\"tilemeta\">25 min + 10 min drying \u00b7 Easy</span></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/c/dinosaur-family\">Dinosaur Family</a><span class=\"tilemeta\">25 min + 1 hr drying \u00b7 Easy</span></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/c/dino-herd\">Dino Herd</a><span class=\"tilemeta\">30 min \u00b7 Easy</span></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/c/extinct-party-animal\">Extinct Party Animal</a><span class=\"tilemeta\">20 min + 15 min drying \u00b7 Easy</span></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/c/dino-tourist\">Dino Tourist</a><span class=\"tilemeta\">10 min \u00b7 Easy</span></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/c/raptor-barista\">Raptor Barista</a><span class=\"tilemeta\">10 min \u00b7 Easy</span></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/c/emotional-support-dinosaur\">Emotional Support Dinosaur</a><span class=\"tilemeta\">25 min + 15 min drying \u00b7 Easy</span></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/c/fossil-hunter\">Fossil Hunter</a><span class=\"tilemeta\">25 min \u00b7 Easy</span></li>\n  </ul>\n</section>",
