    "head": "<header class=\"page-head\">\n  <p class=\"kicker\">Princess Castle</p>\n  <h1>Princess &amp; Fairy Tale Costume Ideas</h1>\n  <p class=\"lede\"><strong>Quick answer:</strong> start with the <a href=\"/c/fairy-tale-princesses\">Fairy Tale Princesses</a> (15 min + 1 hr drying; a dress or crown from the closet), the <a href=\"/c/prince-princess\">Prince &amp; Princess</a> (10 min; crown and cape, thrifted gown and tiara), or the <a href=\"/c/garden-fairy\">Garden Fairy</a> (20 min + 30 min drying; tulle wings, flower crown, wand). Every costume below links to a free step-by-step build guide.</p>\n</header>",
    "tiles": "<section id=\"ssrRegion\" aria-label=\"Princess Castle costume ideas\">\n  <h2>All 13 Princess Castle costumes</h2>\n  <p class=\"intro\">Princess Castle is the royal wing of the Costume Galaxy, with thirteen fairy tale and princess costumes fit for a throne room. Royal gowns, tiaras, fairy wings, witches, and mermaids live here, from the classic Fairy Tale Princess to group builds like Prince and Princess or a fairy sisterhood. Most builds start with a dress from the closet plus a crown, cape, or tulle wings, which keeps the crafting simple and the twirl factor high. It suits kids who have a favorite storybook hero, siblings who want matching magic, and anyone chasing happily-ever-after. Every costume below links to a free step-by-step build guide.</p>\n  <ul>\n      <li><a href=\"/c/fairy-tale-princesses\">Fairy Tale Princesses</a><span class=\"tilemeta\">15 min + 1 hr drying \u00b7 Easy</span></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/c/good-witch-bad-witch\">Good Witch, Bad Witch</a><span class=\"tilemeta\">20 min + 1 hr drying \u00b7 Easy</span></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/c/mermaid-crew\">Mermaid Crew</a><span class=\"tilemeta\">20 min + 10 min drying \u00b7 Easy</span></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/c/enchanted-castle-crew\">Enchanted Castle Crew</a><span class=\"tilemeta\">40 min + 1 hr drying \u00b7 Medium</span></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/c/little-witch\">Little Witch</a><span class=\"tilemeta\">15 min + 10 min drying \u00b7 Easy</span></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/c/garden-gnome\">Garden Gnome</a><span class=\"tilemeta\">30 min + 10 min drying \u00b7 Easy</span></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/c/tooth-fairy\">Tooth and Tooth Fairy</a><span class=\"tilemeta\">45 min + 30 min drying \u00b7 Medium</span></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/c/snow-sisters\">Ice Kingdom Crew</a><span class=\"tilemeta\">30 min + 30 min drying \u00b7 Easy</span></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/c/prince-princess\">Prince &amp; Princess</a><span class=\"tilemeta\">10 min \u00b7 Easy</span></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/c/garden-fairy\">Garden Fairy</a><span class=\"tilemeta\">20 min + 30 min drying \u00b7 Easy</span></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/c/ballerina\">Ballerina</a><span class=\"tilemeta\">20 min \u00b7 Easy</span></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/c/little-prince\">Little Prince</a><span class=\"tilemeta\">20 min + 30 min drying \u00b7 Easy</span></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/c/wayfinder-princess\">Wayfinder Princess</a><span class=\"tilemeta\">35 min + 1 hr drying \u00b7 Easy</span></li>\n  </ul>\n</section>",
