    "head": "<header class=\"page-head\">\n  <p class=\"kicker\">Hero Headquarters</p>\n  <h1>Superhero Costume Ideas</h1>\n  <p class=\"lede\"><strong>Quick answer:</strong> start with the <a href=\"/c/superhero-family\">Superhero Family</a> (30 min; red sweatsuits, black eye masks, felt logo), the <a href=\"/c/backyard-hero\">Backyard Superhero</a> (15 min; short cape, first initial on the chest), or the <a href=\"/c/cardboard-knight\">Cardboard Knight</a> (60 min + 1 hr drying; silver-painted cardboard armor, pool-noodle sword). Every costume below links to a free step-by-step build guide.</p>\n</header>",
    "tiles": "<section id=\"ssrRegion\" aria-label=\"Hero Headquarters costume ideas\">\n  <h2>All 12 Hero Headquarters costumes</h2>\n  <p class=\"intro\">Hero Headquarters is where the Costume Galaxy keeps its capes: twelve superhero costumes for solo saviors and whole teams. Family superhero squads, backyard heroes, knights, and masked crusaders live here, built from sweatsuits, capes, felt masks, and cardboard armor. It is the strongest region for group coordination, because matching colors and a shared emblem make the photo. It suits siblings who want to team up, kids who never take the cape off, and parents joining the mission. Most builds take thirty minutes or less. Every costume below links to a free step-by-step build guide.</p>\n  <ul>\n      <li><a href=\"/c/superhero-family\">Superhero Family</a><span class=\"tilemeta\">30 min \u00b7 Easy</span></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/c/tin-hero\">The Tin Hero</a><span class=\"tilemeta\">25 min \u00b7 Easy</span></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/c/web-slinger-crew\">Web Hero Crew</a><span class=\"tilemeta\">30 min + 30 min drying \u00b7 Easy</span></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/c/tiny-firefighter\">Tiny Firefighter</a><span class=\"tilemeta\">25 min \u00b7 Easy</span></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/c/backyard-hero\">Backyard Superhero</a><span class=\"tilemeta\">15 min \u00b7 Easy</span></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/c/web-hero-duo\">Web Hero Duo</a><span class=\"tilemeta\">25 min + 10 min drying \u00b7 Easy</span></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/c/the-olympians\">The Olympians</a><span class=\"tilemeta\">45 min + 10 min drying \u00b7 Medium</span></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/c/cardboard-knight\">Cardboard Knight</a><span class=\"tilemeta\">60 min + 1 hr drying \u00b7 Medium</span></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/c/caped-duo\">Caped Duo</a><span class=\"tilemeta\">30 min + 30 min drying \u00b7 Easy</span></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/c/hero-squad\">Hero Squad</a><span class=\"tilemeta\">40 min + 1 hr drying \u00b7 Easy</span></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/c/little-lifeguard\">Little Lifeguard</a><span class=\"tilemeta\">20 min + 10 min drying \u00b7 Easy</span></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/c/web-slinger-kid\">Web Hero</a><span class=\"tilemeta\">25 min + 10 min drying \u00b7 Easy</span></li>\n  </ul>\n</section>",
