    "head": "<header class=\"page-head\">\n  <p class=\"kicker\">Animal Kingdom</p>\n  <h1>Animal Costume Ideas</h1>\n  <p class=\"lede\"><strong>Quick answer:</strong> start with the <a href=\"/c/bumble-bee\">Bumble Bee</a> (20 min + 30 min drying; black sweats, yellow tape stripes, felt antennae), the <a href=\"/c/little-lion\">Little Lion</a> (20 min + 1 hr drying; tan sweatsuit, fuzzy mane hood), or the <a href=\"/c/cat-mouse\">Cat &amp; Mouse</a> (15 min + 1 hr drying; cat ears versus mouse ears). Every costume below links to a free step-by-step build guide.</p>\n</header>",
    "tiles": "<section id=\"ssrRegion\" aria-label=\"Animal Kingdom costume ideas\">\n  <h2>All 16 Animal Kingdom costumes</h2>\n  <p class=\"intro\">Animal Kingdom is the wild side of the Costume Galaxy, home to sixteen animal costumes from barnyard to jungle. Bumble bees, lions, cats, sharks, pups, and jungle creatures live here, most built from sweatsuits in the right color plus felt ears, tails, and stripes. It is one of the easiest regions for toddlers, because a cozy onesie-style build doubles as warm pajamas. It suits animal-obsessed kids, sibling pairs like Cat and Mouse, and anyone who wants cute without a craft-store marathon. Every costume below links to a free step-by-step build guide.</p>\n  <ul>\n      <li><a href=\"/c/safari-zoo-crew\">Safari / Zoo Crew</a><span class=\"tilemeta\">25 min + 10 min drying \u00b7 Easy</span></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/c/bumble-bee\">Bumble Bee</a><span class=\"tilemeta\">20 min + 30 min drying \u00b7 Easy</span></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/c/little-lion\">Little Lion</a><span class=\"tilemeta\">20 min + 1 hr drying \u00b7 Easy</span></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/c/little-shark\">Little Shark</a><span class=\"tilemeta\">25 min + 30 min drying \u00b7 Easy</span></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/c/tiny-snail\">Tiny Snail</a><span class=\"tilemeta\">30 min \u00b7 Easy</span></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/c/under-the-sea\">Under the Sea</a><span class=\"tilemeta\">40 min \u00b7 Easy</span></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/c/black-cat\">Black Cat Burglar</a><span class=\"tilemeta\">20 min + 10 min drying \u00b7 Easy</span></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/c/cat-mouse\">Cat &amp; Mouse</a><span class=\"tilemeta\">15 min + 1 hr drying \u00b7 Easy</span></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/c/safari-photographer\">Safari Photographer</a><span class=\"tilemeta\">20 min \u00b7 Easy</span></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/c/penguin-huddle\">Penguin Huddle</a><span class=\"tilemeta\">35 min + 30 min drying \u00b7 Easy</span></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/c/butterfly\">Butterfly</a><span class=\"tilemeta\">40 min + 1 hr drying \u00b7 Medium</span></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/c/ladybug\">Ladybug</a><span class=\"tilemeta\">20 min + 1 hr drying \u00b7 Easy</span></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/c/beekeeper-bee\">Beekeeper &amp; Bee</a><span class=\"tilemeta\">25 min + 10 min drying \u00b7 Easy</span></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/c/blue-heeler-pup\">Blue Heeler Pup</a><span class=\"tilemeta\">25 min + 1 hr drying \u00b7 Easy</span></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/c/scarecrow\">Friendly Scarecrow</a><span class=\"tilemeta\">25 min + 10 min drying \u00b7 Easy</span></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/c/rescue-pups\">Rescue Pup Team</a><span class=\"tilemeta\">30 min + 30 min drying \u00b7 Easy</span></li>\n  </ul>\n</section>",
