    "head": "<header class=\"page-head\">\n  <p class=\"kicker\">Sports Arena</p>\n  <h1>Sports Costume Ideas</h1>\n  <p class=\"lede\"><strong>Quick answer:</strong> start with the <a href=\"/c/soccer-squad\">Soccer Squad</a> (25 min; jerseys, black for the ref, one red card), the <a href=\"/c/basketball-star\">Basketball Star</a> (5 min + 10 min drying; jersey, eye-black stripes), or the <a href=\"/c/referee\">Referee</a> (20 min; striped shirt, whistle, yellow penalty flag). Every costume below links to a free step-by-step build guide.</p>\n</header>",
    "tiles": "<section id=\"ssrRegion\" aria-label=\"Sports Arena costume ideas\">\n  <h2>All 8 Sports Arena costumes</h2>\n  <p class=\"intro\">Sports Arena is the competitive corner of the Costume Galaxy, with eight sports costumes for MVPs and their entourages. Soccer squads, basketball stars, boxers, referees, and cheer crews live here, built mostly from real jerseys and gear you already own. It is the fastest region in the galaxy, and most builds take twenty-five minutes or less, because the uniform does the talking. It suits young athletes, friend groups who want a theme, and the famously reluctant dresser who will wear a jersey but not a costume. Every costume below links to a free step-by-step build guide.</p>\n  <ul>\n      <li><a href=\"/c/soccer-squad\">Soccer Squad</a><span class=\"tilemeta\">25 min \u00b7 Easy</span></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/c/basketball-star\">Basketball Star</a><span class=\"tilemeta\">5 min + 10 min drying \u00b7 Easy</span></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/c/referee\">Referee</a><span class=\"tilemeta\">20 min \u00b7 Easy</span></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/c/boxer\">Boxer</a><span class=\"tilemeta\">10 min + 10 min drying \u00b7 Easy</span></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/c/cheerleader\">Cheerleader</a><span class=\"tilemeta\">15 min \u00b7 Easy</span></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/c/tennis-duo\">Tennis Duo</a><span class=\"tilemeta\">20 min \u00b7 Easy</span></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/c/bowling-pins\">Bowling Pins</a><span class=\"tilemeta\">15 min \u00b7 Easy</span></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/c/ice-skater\">Ice Skater</a><span class=\"tilemeta\">10 min \u00b7 Easy</span></li>\n  </ul>\n</section>",
    "ld": "<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@graph\": [{\"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Pick My Costume\", \"item\": \"https://pickmycostume.com/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Costume Galaxy\", \"item\": \"https://pickmycostume.com/map/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Sports Arena\", \"item\": \"https://pickmycostume.com/map/sports-arena\"}]}, {\"@type\": \"ItemList\", \"name\": \"8 Sports Costume Ideas\", \"numberOfItems\": 8, \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Soccer Squad\", \"url\": \"https://pickmycostume.com/c/soccer-squad\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Basketball Star\", \"url\": \"https://pickmycostume.com/c/basketball-star\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Referee\", \"url\": \"https://pickmycostume.com/c/referee\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 4, \"name\": \"Boxer\", \"url\": \"https://pickmycostume.com/c/boxer\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 5, \"name\": \"Cheerleader\", \"url\": \"https://pickmycostume.com/c/cheerleader\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 6, \"name\": \"Tennis Duo\", \"url\": \"https://pickmycostume.com/c/tennis-duo\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 7, \"name\": \"Bowling Pins\", \"url\": \"https://pickmycostume.com/c/bowling-pins\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 8, \"name\": \"Ice Skater\", \"url\": \"https://pickmycostume.com/c/ice-skater\"}]}]}</script>"
