    "seoTitle": "24 Funny DIY Halloween Costumes (Silly, Easy & Last-Minute) | Pick My Costume",
    "seoDesc": "24 funny DIY Halloween costumes \u2014 moth and porch light, error 404, party pinata. Easy builds, several in 10 minutes. Free guides.",
    "head": "<header class=\"page-head\">\n  <p class=\"kicker\">Silly Street</p>\n  <h1>Funny DIY Halloween Costumes</h1>\n  <p class=\"lede\"><strong>Quick answer:</strong> start with the <a href=\"/c/moth-porch-light\">Moth and Porch Light</a> (40 min; cardboard wings / yellow and a lampshade), the <a href=\"/c/error-404\">Error 404</a> (10 min; all black, blank white page), or the <a href=\"/c/party-pinata\">Party Pinata</a> (40 min + 30 min drying; cardboard box, rainbow fringe). Every costume below links to a free step-by-step build guide.</p>\n</header>",
    "tiles": "<section id=\"ssrRegion\" aria-label=\"Silly Street costume ideas\">\n  <h2>All 24 Silly Street costumes</h2>\n  <p class=\"intro\">Silly Street is the pure-comedy borough of the Costume Galaxy: twenty-four funny costumes with zero scares. The Moth and the Porch Light, Error 404, the Party Pinata, and a parade of pun builds live here, most of them cardboard, face paint, and thrift-store finds. Several go from idea to party-ready in about ten minutes, which makes this the last-minute lifeline of the galaxy. It suits class clowns, office costume contests, and anyone who would rather get the laugh than the fright. Every costume below links to a free step-by-step build guide.</p>\n  <ul>\n      <li><a href=\"/c/fuzzy-monster\">Fuzzy Monster</a><span class=\"tilemeta\">15 min + 30 min drying \u00b7 Easy</span></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/c/pocket-plush\">Pocket Plush Monster</a><span class=\"tilemeta\">25 min + 30 min drying \u00b7 Easy</span></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/c/emoji-crew\">Emoji Crew</a><span class=\"tilemeta\">15 min \u00b7 Easy</span></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/c/robot-crew\">Cardboard Robot Crew</a><span class=\"tilemeta\">45 min \u00b7 Medium</span></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/c/decades-crew\">Decades Crew</a><span class=\"tilemeta\">20 min \u00b7 Easy</span></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/c/rain-cloud-rainbow\">Rain Cloud and Rainbow</a><span class=\"tilemeta\">30 min + 1 hr drying \u00b7 Easy</span></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/c/sun-moon\">Sun and Moon</a><span class=\"tilemeta\">40 min + 30 min drying \u00b7 Easy</span></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/c/moth-porch-light\">Moth and Porch Light</a><span class=\"tilemeta\">40 min \u00b7 Medium</span></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/c/plug-socket\">Plug and Socket</a><span class=\"tilemeta\">45 min + 1 hr drying \u00b7 Easy</span></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/c/lost-tourist\">Lost Tourist</a><span class=\"tilemeta\">10 min \u00b7 Easy</span></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/c/crowd-camouflage\">Crowd Camouflage</a><span class=\"tilemeta\">5 min \u00b7 Easy</span></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/c/error-404\">Error 404</a><span class=\"tilemeta\">10 min \u00b7 Easy</span></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/c/astronaut\">Astronaut</a><span class=\"tilemeta\">25 min \u00b7 Easy</span></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/c/robot-ranger\">Robot Ranger</a><span class=\"tilemeta\">60 min \u00b7 Medium</span></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/c/pop-star\">Pop Star</a><span class=\"tilemeta\">15 min \u00b7 Easy</span></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/c/daisy\">Daisy</a><span class=\"tilemeta\">30 min + 1 hr drying \u00b7 Easy</span></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/c/little-artist\">Little Artist</a><span class=\"tilemeta\">15 min + 1 hr drying \u00b7 Easy</span></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/c/baby-pumpkin\">Baby Pumpkin</a><span class=\"tilemeta\">20 min \u00b7 Easy</span></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/c/pirate-captain\">Pirate Captain</a><span class=\"tilemeta\">30 min \u00b7 Easy</span></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/c/cowboy-duo\">Cowboy and Cowgirl</a><span class=\"tilemeta\">25 min \u00b7 Easy</span></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/c/moonwalk-star\">Moonwalking Pop Star</a><span class=\"tilemeta\">25 min + 30 min drying \u00b7 Easy</span></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/c/party-pinata\">Party Pinata</a><span class=\"tilemeta\">40 min + 30 min drying \u00b7 Medium</span></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/c/fuzzy-gremlin\">Fuzzy Gremlin Plush</a><span class=\"tilemeta\">25 min + 30 min drying \u00b7 Easy</span></li>\n      <li><a href=\"/c/chill-painter\">Chill Painter with Fro</a><span class=\"tilemeta\">20 min + 1 hr drying \u00b7 Easy</span></li>\n  </ul>\n</section>",
